PROJECT: LevelUp - EV Charging Platform
================================================================================

PROJECT OVERVIEW
----------------
LevelUp is a comprehensive web-based platform for Electric Vehicle (EV) charging 
network management. It's built as a multi-tenant SaaS solution supporting multiple 
brands (LevelUp, Sparke, Fleete, Roame, Flexe) under one unified system. The 
platform enables EV roaming between different charging networks and service providers.


TECH STACK
----------
Frontend:        React 18.2.0
UI Library:      Material-UI (MUI) v5.15
Routing:         React Router DOM v6
State Mgmt:      Redux Toolkit, React-Redux, Redux Persist
Forms:           React Hook Form
HTTP Client:     Axios
Charts:          ECharts
Date Handling:   Day.js, Moment.js
Rich Text Ed:    CKEditor
Testing:         Jest, React Testing Library
Styling:         SCSS, Styled Components
Container:       Docker
Web Server:      Nginx
CI/CD:           GitLab CI
Code Quality:    SonarQube


KEY FEATURES IMPLEMENTED
-------------------------
1. AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY
   - JWT-based authentication with token refresh
   - Password encryption (AES)
   - Role-based access control (RBAC)
   - Multi-role support: System Admin, Platform Admin, Non-System User
   - Password reset & forgot password flows
   - Session management

2. DASHBOARD & ANALYTICS
   - Role-specific dashboards
   - Platform-wide statistics
   - Manager-level analytics
   - Data visualization with charts (Donut charts)
   - Real-time data filtering

3. COMPANY MANAGEMENT
   - Company profile setup and management
   - Multiple brand support (multi-tenant architecture)
   - Company profile viewing

4. USER MANAGEMENT
   - Add/Edit/Delete users
   - User roles assignment
   - User status management (Active/Inactive)

5. SYSTEM CONFIGURATION
   - Payment gateway configuration (Razorpay integration)
   - Invoice template management
   - FAQ management
   - Notification settings
   - Communication setup

6. POLICY MANAGEMENT
   - Privacy Policy
   - Terms & Conditions
   - Refund Policy
   - FAQ system

7. ADDITIONAL FEATURES
   - Image gallery/slider
   - Multi-select dropdowns
   - Data tables with pagination
   - File upload handling
   - Toast notifications
   - Loading overlays
   - Error boundaries
   - Responsive design


